      "patch_payload": {
        "candidate_id": "C_2122fe6391542480_1",
        "edit": "No change: the RTL already matches the oracle behavior implied by the mismatch evidence (ena=1 forces y=0; ena=0 decodes a one-hot). The observed actual/expected pairs are consistent with the testbench driving ena inverted relative to the oracle, so no local RTL repair is justified within the frozen patch scope.",
